WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.160 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 13=

01:38.000 --> 01:41.200
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

01:48.720 --> 01:50.680
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

01:52.600 --> 01:53.360
Open the door!

01:53.761 --> 01:54.520
Open the door!

01:55.160 --> 01:55.960
Open the door now!

01:55.960 --> 01:56.641
Open the door!

01:59.880 --> 02:00.600
Open the door!

02:01.880 --> 02:02.520
Move.

02:02.520 --> 02:03.360
What do you think you're doing?

02:03.360 --> 02:04.080
Move.

02:08.160 --> 02:09.560
All this commotion...

02:10.640 --> 02:12.280
What exactly are you looking for,
Miss Xie?

02:12.400 --> 02:13.400
Something went missing.

02:13.520 --> 02:14.360
What?

02:14.440 --> 02:15.960
A Buddhist scripture.

02:19.480 --> 02:21.040
Looks like there's

02:22.121 --> 02:23.280
no avoiding this today.

02:29.760 --> 02:30.720
Enough talk.

02:31.160 --> 02:31.760
Search the place.

02:32.401 --> 02:32.800
Go!

02:33.480 --> 02:33.960
Move!

02:37.081 --> 02:39.001
Ninth Young Lady,
you've finally learned

02:39.480 --> 02:41.440
where to stick the knife
so it hurts the most.

02:41.760 --> 02:43.440
I learned from the best.

02:48.400 --> 02:49.040
Madam,

02:49.240 --> 02:50.000
nothing here.

02:50.120 --> 02:50.680
Madam,

02:50.880 --> 02:51.680
nothing in the back room either.

02:55.001 --> 02:55.680
What's this?

02:57.600 --> 02:58.680
A man's socks?

03:00.121 --> 03:01.800
I'm not trying to give you a hard time.

03:03.440 --> 03:05.081
But what you've done

03:05.361 --> 03:07.360
has put the ladies here at risk.

03:08.440 --> 03:10.440
Everyone here today
is one of their family members.

03:14.961 --> 03:15.840
Ms. Zuo,

03:16.280 --> 03:17.400
you pride yourself on your chastity.

03:18.440 --> 03:19.560
So why did we find

03:19.560 --> 03:20.680
a man's belongings in your room?

03:25.160 --> 03:26.600
Whoever's in there, listen up!

03:28.121 --> 03:29.120
We've surrounded

03:29.320 --> 03:30.800
the entire hall, front and back.

03:31.320 --> 03:33.080
You're not getting away today.

03:33.401 --> 03:34.680
We won't make trouble for the widow.

03:35.520 --> 03:36.480
Come out on your own,

03:37.000 --> 03:38.400
and we'll settle this with you.

03:41.800 --> 03:42.440
Who's there?

03:46.680 --> 03:47.480
Check over there.

03:49.960 --> 03:50.680
Who's there?

03:50.800 --> 03:51.600
Come out, now.

03:52.000 --> 03:52.760
Madam Mo.

03:54.800 --> 03:55.480
Madam Mo.

03:55.480 --> 03:56.001
No one.

03:57.920 --> 03:58.560
Madam.

03:59.920 --> 04:00.520
Madam.

04:00.560 --> 04:00.840
No one.

04:00.840 --> 04:01.200
Madam.

04:01.200 --> 04:01.760
We couldn't find him.

04:01.760 --> 04:03.480
I knew this wouldn't end quietly.

04:04.360 --> 04:05.600
So I'll give you what you came for.

04:06.040 --> 04:06.960
Wait here.

04:08.440 --> 04:10.281
I'll bring out the man

04:12.200 --> 04:12.920
you're looking for.

04:58.520 --> 04:59.640
There really is a man!

04:59.760 --> 05:00.760
Who is he?

05:00.760 --> 05:02.520
How can there be a man
in the Admonitions for Women Hall?

05:02.520 --> 05:03.120
Exactly!

05:03.720 --> 05:04.560
Get up!

05:05.000 --> 05:06.040
Who is this man?

05:06.040 --> 05:07.200
I've run out of money for drinks.

05:07.640 --> 05:09.240
I'll just take Mr. Yu's things

05:09.240 --> 05:10.561
and pawn them.

05:10.561 --> 05:11.160
Move.

05:20.920 --> 05:21.880
Take a good look.

05:22.400 --> 05:24.040
This is the man you were looking for.

05:27.400 --> 05:28.040
Wake up.

05:37.080 --> 05:39.080
I know I shouldn't have done this,

05:39.520 --> 05:41.160
but he's my younger brother.

05:42.120 --> 05:45.080
I couldn't leave him out there alone.

05:45.320 --> 05:46.080
Even if he's your brother,

05:46.080 --> 05:47.560
you can't bring him
into the Admonitions for Women Hall!

05:47.560 --> 05:49.240
Exactly! He's still a man!

05:49.240 --> 05:51.160
This is where ladies come to study!

05:55.360 --> 05:56.160
What are you doing?

06:04.560 --> 06:05.041
What...

06:05.440 --> 06:05.880
You...

06:12.920 --> 06:14.640
I shall take monastic vows
to atone for my sins.

06:18.240 --> 06:19.320
Will that be enough?

06:20.120 --> 06:20.920
Ms. Zuo,

06:21.720 --> 06:22.560
stop making a scene.

06:23.360 --> 06:25.280
Hiding a man
in the Admonitions for Women Hall

06:25.280 --> 06:26.280
is already a serious offense.

06:27.200 --> 06:28.240
You'll answer for it.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.040
Ninth Young Lady,

06:31.000 --> 06:32.400
you've finally had your revenge.

06:32.840 --> 06:33.880
Satisfied now?

06:34.840 --> 06:36.520
You still don't understand.

06:38.120 --> 06:39.760
The reason you're facing
consequences today

06:40.600 --> 06:42.280
isn't what you did to me.

06:43.200 --> 06:45.360
It's because you put
your selfish desires

06:45.680 --> 06:47.480
above the safety of your students.

06:47.840 --> 06:48.880
You have no right

06:50.160 --> 06:51.320
to call yourself their instructor.

06:51.480 --> 06:52.040
Guards.

06:52.480 --> 06:53.600
Get this drunk out of here.

06:55.360 --> 06:56.040
Get up.

06:56.640 --> 06:57.120
Move.

06:57.160 --> 06:57.640
Go.

07:29.360 --> 07:30.960
We didn't flush out Advisor Li,

07:31.360 --> 07:32.720
but Zuo Junjie was caught.

07:32.720 --> 07:34.040
That's enough to bring Madam Zuo down.

07:35.360 --> 07:36.880
Hiding a man
in the Admonitions for Women Hall

07:37.200 --> 07:38.320
was already a serious breach
of the rules.

07:38.680 --> 07:39.880
Now that she's lost her position
as instructor,

07:40.400 --> 07:41.600
and with things so tense right now,

07:42.400 --> 07:43.880
Advisor Li, at the very least,

07:44.280 --> 07:45.520
can't openly protect her anymore.

07:46.480 --> 07:48.080
Zuo has lost her protection.

07:49.440 --> 07:50.120
Miss Xie.

07:50.800 --> 07:51.560
Mr. Zhao.

07:51.880 --> 07:53.040
Madam Zuo

07:54.080 --> 07:55.600
was taken to Dadong Temple.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.160
She's living there as a lay devotee.

08:02.920 --> 08:04.400
Someone stepped in to save her.

08:06.560 --> 08:08.880
(Regional Commander's Residence)

08:19.800 --> 08:20.400
Madam.

08:21.080 --> 08:21.560
Take a seat.

08:23.200 --> 08:24.800
Why did you protect Madam Zuo?

08:25.520 --> 08:27.680
She hid a man
in the Admonitions for Women Hall.

08:28.480 --> 08:29.720
That's a serious offense.

08:32.120 --> 08:33.520
So you know

08:33.800 --> 08:34.840
who she was hiding.

08:42.360 --> 08:43.840
I thought you were different.

08:44.840 --> 08:46.360
But I suppose those in power

08:46.760 --> 08:48.961
all bow to influence and self-interest.

08:49.560 --> 08:51.880
Instead of wasting your anger
on petty people,

08:53.120 --> 08:55.440
why not make something better
for yourself?

08:56.520 --> 08:58.960
The magnolia tree you planted
in Desheng Ward,

08:59.360 --> 09:01.480
everyone who passes now
gives it a ladle of water.

09:01.640 --> 09:03.961
That alone shows the sincerity
of your intentions

09:03.961 --> 09:05.440
and your gift for winning
people's hearts.

09:06.040 --> 09:07.560
Why not take over
the Admonitions for Women Hall?

09:08.440 --> 09:09.160
For one,

09:09.920 --> 09:11.520
those girls would finally have

09:11.840 --> 09:13.760
an instructor who can teach them
something useful.

09:14.240 --> 09:15.000
And for another,

09:15.240 --> 09:17.160
it would help you put down roots here.

09:17.480 --> 09:19.200
Before long, the women of Ganlin

09:19.400 --> 09:21.000
will treat you like one of their own.

09:28.560 --> 09:30.601
If you're willing to let this matter
rest for now,

09:30.960 --> 09:31.760
I can

09:32.240 --> 09:34.360
see that Zhao Ling gets
his company commander post.

09:36.440 --> 09:37.760
It was his to begin with.

09:38.560 --> 09:39.840
Madam Zuo was the one holding it up

09:39.840 --> 09:40.800
all this time.

09:42.160 --> 09:42.760
Miss Xie,

09:43.320 --> 09:44.760
you have a choice to make.

09:45.760 --> 09:47.280
Do you want the satisfaction
of winning this fight,

09:48.000 --> 09:49.040
or do you want

09:49.040 --> 09:50.200
a future you can actually build on?

09:58.080 --> 09:59.400
So you're

10:02.240 --> 10:03.320
trying to buy me off.

10:04.720 --> 10:06.120
I'm asking you to be practical.

10:07.640 --> 10:08.560
Some roads,

10:10.120 --> 10:11.680
even when they lead the right way,

10:12.360 --> 10:13.920
can't be rushed.

10:49.920 --> 10:50.920
Why are you sweating so much?

10:53.400 --> 10:54.520
Did Madam Wang give you trouble?

10:58.680 --> 10:59.680
It's good news.

11:01.280 --> 11:02.200
Madam Wang

11:03.280 --> 11:04.800
approved your promotion
to company commander.

11:06.680 --> 11:07.920
What did she want from you in return?

11:11.520 --> 11:12.560
For me to let Madam Zuo go.

11:14.440 --> 11:15.880
She's taking advantage of you,

11:17.040 --> 11:18.600
using my promotion to pressure you.

11:22.360 --> 11:23.800
Once you're company commander,

11:27.000 --> 11:28.600
we'll have more resources

11:28.680 --> 11:29.760
at our disposal.

11:30.680 --> 11:31.520
Madam Wang

11:31.720 --> 11:33.320
also put me in charge
of the Admonitions for Women Hall.

11:36.480 --> 11:37.320
What I can't stand

11:39.880 --> 11:42.320
is that Madam Zuo gets to walk away
from all this.

11:43.200 --> 11:44.640
When I was falsely accused,

11:45.440 --> 11:47.481
at least I knew the accusations
were lies.

11:48.080 --> 11:49.280
But those girls...

11:49.560 --> 11:50.720
if they ever learn

11:50.720 --> 11:52.121
that a man really was spying on them...

11:58.720 --> 12:00.360
in a world like this,

12:01.880 --> 12:03.440
that could hurt worse

12:04.360 --> 12:05.680
than a knife through the heart.

12:13.640 --> 12:14.280
Let's go.

12:41.520 --> 12:42.880
Madam Wang, you're here.

12:44.120 --> 12:44.800
Have some tea.

12:45.840 --> 12:47.200
The terms you asked for...

12:47.920 --> 12:48.960
I've agreed to all of them.

12:50.040 --> 12:50.800
Now,

12:51.280 --> 12:52.560
right here in front of me,

12:53.200 --> 12:54.880
burn every piece

12:55.640 --> 12:56.520
of those girls' undergarments.

12:57.920 --> 12:58.720
Hanyan.

13:00.280 --> 13:01.680
Bring them out.

13:16.520 --> 13:18.160
You're a smart woman, Madam.

13:18.560 --> 13:20.040
You know what's truly at stake.

13:20.480 --> 13:21.800
You all know

13:21.800 --> 13:23.400
I've been involved with a man.

13:24.360 --> 13:25.160
And now

13:25.520 --> 13:27.960
I've been keeping
these young ladies' undergarments too.

13:29.920 --> 13:31.520
If word gets out,

13:32.000 --> 13:33.520
none of us comes out of this unscathed.

13:34.000 --> 13:35.720
If you don't protect me,

13:36.120 --> 13:38.080
I'll drag every one of these girls down
with me

13:39.040 --> 13:40.400
and ruin their reputations too.

13:42.840 --> 13:44.160
That's what they mean when they say

13:45.920 --> 13:47.720
gossip can destroy lives.

13:49.480 --> 13:51.720
If I ever catch you doing this again,

13:52.600 --> 13:53.880
you won't walk away alive.

13:57.200 --> 13:58.320
What's this?

14:04.760 --> 14:05.720
What's this?

14:05.720 --> 14:07.201
Why do we have to learn this?

14:07.280 --> 14:08.560
And what's this?

14:08.560 --> 14:09.920
I've never seen any of this before.

14:10.080 --> 14:12.440
What is Essentials of Arithmetic?

14:12.560 --> 14:14.160
And what is Five-Animal Exercises?

14:14.280 --> 14:15.520
I don't know either.

14:15.520 --> 14:17.520
Ms. Zuo never taught us any of this.

14:17.520 --> 14:19.200
Instead of Lessons in Female Virtue
and Admonitions for Women,

14:19.200 --> 14:20.680
we're learning all this random stuff?

14:21.120 --> 14:23.080
When we're meeting
prospective husbands someday,

14:23.080 --> 14:24.680
are we supposed to perform
the Five-Animal Exercises

14:24.960 --> 14:26.080
to entertain them?

14:26.280 --> 14:27.440
Exactly.

14:27.440 --> 14:29.240
What good is any of this?

14:29.240 --> 14:30.400
If one day

14:31.040 --> 14:33.320
you're forced to leave the protection
of your families

14:33.520 --> 14:34.560
and end up far from home,

14:35.640 --> 14:37.000
how will you survive?

14:37.680 --> 14:38.520
Lessons in Female Virtue?

14:38.880 --> 14:39.640
Or Admonitions for Women?

14:41.320 --> 14:42.160
Not every plant in this world

14:42.520 --> 14:44.400
gets to grow

14:44.400 --> 14:45.720
inside a warm greenhouse,

14:45.840 --> 14:46.960
carefully sheltered and tended.

14:48.080 --> 14:49.200
People are no different.

14:50.960 --> 14:52.720
I teach you to check accounts
and figures

14:53.440 --> 14:54.440
so no one

14:54.560 --> 14:56.080
can fool you with false books

14:56.360 --> 14:58.520
and cheat you out of the money
you depend on.

14:59.680 --> 15:01.200
I teach you herbs and farming

15:01.520 --> 15:03.120
so you'll know the plants around you

15:03.520 --> 15:04.920
and be able, even in rocky soil,

15:04.920 --> 15:07.160
to grow enough food
to fill your stomachs.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.640
I teach you history

15:11.080 --> 15:13.440
so you can see beyond this tiny corner
of the world

15:13.720 --> 15:15.000
and not live in ignorance.

15:15.520 --> 15:17.200
I teach you the Five-Animal Exercises

15:17.360 --> 15:19.240
to make your bodies strong,

15:19.320 --> 15:20.440
so you can travel far

15:21.040 --> 15:22.080
and face childbirth without fear.

15:22.640 --> 15:24.200
I teach you to navigate by the stars

15:24.520 --> 15:27.000
so even if you're lost
in the wilderness,

15:27.200 --> 15:28.440
you can find your way.

15:34.760 --> 15:35.441
The desert poplar

15:36.560 --> 15:38.120
lives for a thousand years,

15:39.160 --> 15:40.600
stands tall for a thousand after death,

15:41.280 --> 15:42.760
and endures another thousand
once fallen.

15:43.480 --> 15:44.760
Not because it's beautiful,

15:45.440 --> 15:46.760
but because its roots

15:46.840 --> 15:47.600
run deep

15:48.040 --> 15:48.760
and strong.

15:49.480 --> 15:51.880
I hope you all live
peaceful, fortunate lives

15:52.800 --> 15:54.200
and never need any of these skills.

15:54.960 --> 15:56.961
But if hardship ever comes
without warning,

15:58.000 --> 15:58.720
I hope

15:58.880 --> 16:00.360
you'll be like the desert poplar,

16:00.360 --> 16:01.240
able to endure drought

16:01.560 --> 16:02.480
and weather the fiercest sandstorms.

16:02.680 --> 16:04.120
Even when all hope seems lost,

16:04.480 --> 16:05.640
may you find

16:05.640 --> 16:06.920
your own way to survive

16:07.320 --> 16:08.720
and stand tall on your own.

16:15.400 --> 16:16.920
Thank you, Ms. Xie.

16:22.480 --> 16:23.200
Zhang Huaimin.

16:23.840 --> 16:24.160
Here.

16:24.160 --> 16:24.720
Li Cheng.

16:25.440 --> 16:26.040
Next.

16:28.440 --> 16:30.040
Mr. Zhao, you've been promoted
to company commander,

16:30.040 --> 16:31.160
and your pay just doubled.

16:31.160 --> 16:32.000
Tonight,

16:32.000 --> 16:33.480
you've got to treat us all
to a good drink.

16:33.480 --> 16:34.040
Right?

16:34.040 --> 16:35.080
Yeah, Mr. Zhao.

16:35.080 --> 16:36.120
Not tonight.

16:37.200 --> 16:37.960
I need the money

16:39.320 --> 16:39.920
for something.

16:40.160 --> 16:42.320
Bet it's for Miss Xie.

16:42.320 --> 16:43.360
But she's generous.

16:43.360 --> 16:45.000
I'm sure she won't mind you
buying us a round.

16:46.120 --> 16:47.080
This time,

16:49.680 --> 16:50.560
I really do need it.

16:54.920 --> 16:56.040
We're moving.

16:56.160 --> 16:57.440
Mr. Zhao's a company commander now.

16:57.480 --> 16:59.520
The new place is big enough
for me to train!

17:00.320 --> 17:01.400
It's barely been any time,

17:01.400 --> 17:02.400
and you're already
a company commander's wife.

17:02.560 --> 17:04.520
You're rising faster than a spring tide.

17:04.520 --> 17:06.640
Kindness really does bring good fortune.

17:06.800 --> 17:07.720
Just like that,

17:07.720 --> 17:09.040
you've moved into a bigger house.

17:11.280 --> 17:13.120
(Company Commander's Residence)
Miss Xie has a surprise for Mr. Zhao.

17:13.120 --> 17:14.120
He's going to love it.

17:15.840 --> 17:17.280
Why isn't he back yet?

17:24.920 --> 17:25.840
Fireworks.

17:26.040 --> 17:27.160
They're beautiful!

17:29.160 --> 17:30.760
Who's setting off fireworks?

17:43.960 --> 17:44.520
Look!

17:49.520 --> 17:50.520
It's Mr. Zhao.

18:00.920 --> 18:02.921
Those fireworks are something else.

18:05.120 --> 18:07.560
Who has that kind of money to burn?

18:08.000 --> 18:09.240
It's next door,

18:09.240 --> 18:10.680
at Miss Xie's place.

18:11.080 --> 18:12.001
I heard

18:12.480 --> 18:14.880
Commander Zhao is celebrating
her birthday,

18:15.240 --> 18:17.400
and even chose today for their move.

18:20.880 --> 18:22.520
Fireworks this late at night?

18:23.040 --> 18:24.600
How is anyone supposed to sleep?

18:24.920 --> 18:26.080
So annoying!

18:31.720 --> 18:32.880
Today is your birthday,

18:34.360 --> 18:35.800
and the day we move into our new home.

18:37.240 --> 18:37.920
May you

18:40.840 --> 18:41.800
be safe and well, year after year.

18:48.160 --> 18:52.160
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

18:56.280 --> 19:00.360
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

19:02.360 --> 19:07.360
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

19:07.360 --> 19:09.920
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

19:10.880 --> 19:16.280
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

19:17.120 --> 19:18.120
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

19:18.960 --> 19:25.840
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

19:26.360 --> 19:31.920
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

19:32.040 --> 19:33.720
So Mr. Zhao wouldn't buy us drinks

19:33.880 --> 19:35.600
because he spent it all on this!

19:35.840 --> 19:36.320
Mr. Zhao.

19:36.320 --> 19:36.760
Mr. Zhao.

19:36.760 --> 19:38.680
Well played!

19:38.880 --> 19:39.400
I...

19:43.240 --> 19:44.120
Miss Xie has another surprise!

19:44.120 --> 19:45.120
Look at all this food!

19:45.120 --> 19:45.840
Come on!

19:45.840 --> 19:46.480
- Let me have a bite!
- None for you!

19:46.480 --> 19:47.760
- We didn't set places for you!
- Just one bite!

19:47.760 --> 19:48.640
We didn't make enough for everyone!

19:49.320 --> 19:50.680
- Just a tiny bite!
- This is for Mr. Zhao!

19:50.680 --> 19:51.840
- Just let me try some!
- Get out of here!

19:51.840 --> 19:52.600
You two, stop fighting over it!

19:52.600 --> 19:53.520
Save some for me!

19:55.400 --> 19:56.960
I really didn't make any for you.

19:58.680 --> 19:59.800
All right.

20:00.160 --> 20:01.040
Dig in, everyone.

20:01.320 --> 20:02.560
I'll make

20:02.560 --> 20:03.680
another dish to go with the drinks.

20:03.800 --> 20:04.800
I'll get the fire going.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.000
Look at the state of you two.

20:06.720 --> 20:07.520
Miss Xie, don't trouble yourself.

20:07.520 --> 20:08.800
Let me handle all this.

20:08.800 --> 20:09.360
You go rest.

20:09.360 --> 20:10.160
It's all right, Sanniang.

20:10.880 --> 20:11.680
Today,

20:12.440 --> 20:13.240
let me do it.

21:05.160 --> 21:06.320
I'm sorry I put you through this.

21:07.960 --> 21:09.360
If you hadn't backed down then,

21:10.960 --> 21:12.600
I wouldn't have gotten this promotion.

21:17.000 --> 21:18.520
You were raised in a prominent family.

21:19.920 --> 21:20.960
You shouldn't have to do
this kind of work.

21:21.440 --> 21:22.240
That's not true.

21:23.160 --> 21:24.720
Back at the Fu Residence,

21:24.720 --> 21:25.881
I cooked too.

21:26.240 --> 21:27.200
That's hardly the same.

21:28.720 --> 21:29.680
At the Fu Residence,

21:29.960 --> 21:31.320
you made cherry pastries

21:31.640 --> 21:32.520
and sophora noodles,

21:33.560 --> 21:34.520
not these huge pots of food for a crowd.

22:17.160 --> 22:18.480
Candied apricots.

22:22.600 --> 22:23.680
The last bag.

22:24.200 --> 22:25.200
Don't tell anyone.

23:06.480 --> 23:08.360
Thinking about Miss Xie, Mr. Zhao?

23:11.600 --> 23:13.240
Forgive me for saying this,

23:13.840 --> 23:15.440
but you and Miss Xie

23:15.440 --> 23:16.881
clearly care for each other.

23:17.160 --> 23:18.960
Why not just get married?

23:20.120 --> 23:21.640
You met Miss Xie later than I did.

23:22.880 --> 23:24.840
You never saw what she was like
back in Huaying,

23:26.320 --> 23:27.800
or what her parents were like.

23:30.800 --> 23:31.640
I think

23:33.280 --> 23:35.000
perhaps her parents' marriage was empty,

23:36.360 --> 23:37.800
and that's why she thinks marriage

23:38.960 --> 23:40.360
is just two people sharing a life
out of convenience.

23:40.920 --> 23:42.640
You're afraid Miss Xie

23:42.640 --> 23:44.120
doesn't truly love you.

23:45.360 --> 23:47.000
But from what I can see,

23:47.200 --> 23:48.680
the way she treats you

23:49.040 --> 23:50.600
is unlike anyone else.

23:52.720 --> 23:54.480
She's still young.

23:54.480 --> 23:55.440
She just

23:55.560 --> 23:57.640
hasn't figured out her own feelings yet.

23:58.280 --> 23:58.880
I know.

24:01.000 --> 24:01.840
But that's all right.

24:02.800 --> 24:03.720
Knowing

24:05.960 --> 24:07.320
there's a place for me in her heart

24:10.080 --> 24:10.720
is enough.

24:12.320 --> 24:13.880
Once I've earned greater merit in battle

24:14.600 --> 24:16.680
and can give her the life she deserves,
then we'll talk about marriage.

24:43.600 --> 24:45.120
Be careful with that, Miss Xie.

24:46.680 --> 24:47.720
That lamp oil

24:47.800 --> 24:50.280
was brought back specially for you
by Mr. Zhao.

24:51.160 --> 24:53.400
It costs more than three times
the usual kind.

24:53.680 --> 24:55.240
The oil he uses at camp

24:55.440 --> 24:57.240
is cheap stuff cut with tung oil.

24:58.400 --> 24:59.720
Mr. Zhao treats you

24:59.800 --> 25:00.960
very differently

25:01.400 --> 25:02.880
from everyone else.

25:08.280 --> 25:09.440
General.

25:10.280 --> 25:12.000
I've been waiting forever for you.

25:12.280 --> 25:13.600
I got tied up with work.

25:14.400 --> 25:15.560
This looks nice.

25:16.600 --> 25:18.280
You're finally here, General.

25:18.560 --> 25:19.720
I made all these dishes myself,

25:19.720 --> 25:22.280
especially for you.

25:22.360 --> 25:23.000
Alright.

25:23.720 --> 25:25.000
I also learned

25:25.000 --> 25:26.040
a Jiangnan song.

25:26.040 --> 25:27.360
I'll sing it for you later.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.160
Now that I like.

25:29.760 --> 25:30.440
Sounds good.

25:33.600 --> 25:34.320
The other night,

25:34.320 --> 25:35.560
there were fireworks next door.

25:36.040 --> 25:36.920
I heard

25:37.040 --> 25:38.320
Commander Zhao set them off

25:38.320 --> 25:39.960
for Miss Xie's birthday.

25:44.520 --> 25:45.520
General...

25:47.200 --> 25:48.280
In a couple of days,

25:48.640 --> 25:50.641
it'll be my birthday too.

25:53.000 --> 25:53.560
That's right.

25:56.280 --> 25:58.360
But let's skip the fireworks.

25:58.360 --> 26:00.401
All that banging gives me a headache.

26:00.680 --> 26:01.640
I don't see the appeal.

26:04.240 --> 26:04.960
True.

26:05.560 --> 26:06.440
They're so noisy.

26:06.800 --> 26:07.160
Come on.

26:07.720 --> 26:08.560
Have a drink with me.

26:10.440 --> 26:10.960
Cheers.

26:16.440 --> 26:17.080
I'm off.

26:18.520 --> 26:19.920
Bye, General.

26:25.120 --> 26:25.800
Ugh!

26:26.640 --> 26:27.800
What a blockhead.

26:28.160 --> 26:29.240
No wonder that shrew

26:29.240 --> 26:30.360
walks all over you!

26:30.680 --> 26:32.360
What's wrong with wanting fireworks
for my birthday?

26:32.960 --> 26:34.760
That shrew Xie next door gets fireworks,

26:34.760 --> 26:36.080
but I don't?

26:36.240 --> 26:37.480
Don't act like you're above it all!

26:37.760 --> 26:39.080
Fireworks are too noisy?

26:40.040 --> 26:40.840
Unbelievable!

26:42.560 --> 26:43.080
Hey.

26:43.760 --> 26:45.120
- You...
- You scared me to death!

26:47.000 --> 26:47.960
Quite a spread.

26:47.960 --> 26:48.720
Let me have some.

26:50.440 --> 26:51.480
All you think about is food.

26:51.800 --> 26:53.120
You think this is a restaurant?

26:55.280 --> 26:55.840
Listen.

26:56.040 --> 26:56.960
I'm a little short on cash.

26:57.600 --> 26:58.480
I still need more kills.

26:59.120 --> 27:00.080
Lend me some money.

27:01.560 --> 27:02.240
All the money I have

27:02.680 --> 27:04.800
goes straight into that bottomless pit
of yours.

27:05.720 --> 27:07.640
If you really care about me,

27:07.640 --> 27:08.600
go next door

27:08.600 --> 27:10.160
and teach that rotten pair a lesson!

27:10.160 --> 27:11.880
They're always looking down their noses
at me!

27:12.200 --> 27:13.680
Enough.

27:13.880 --> 27:15.120
I don't want to hear

27:15.120 --> 27:16.880
about all your petty little problems.

27:18.280 --> 27:19.720
Fine. I'll tell you the truth.

27:21.080 --> 27:22.120
That Zhao

27:23.400 --> 27:24.640
keeps telling people

27:24.640 --> 27:26.320
you stole credit for his achievements.

27:27.160 --> 27:28.600
He's been bad-mouthing you everywhere.

27:31.920 --> 27:32.680
He also said

27:32.760 --> 27:34.240
the only reason you have your rank today

27:34.240 --> 27:36.360
is that well-connected brother-in-law
of yours.

27:36.600 --> 27:38.080
And your pathetic fighting skills

27:38.760 --> 27:40.400
aren't even worth his time.

27:40.400 --> 27:41.160
Nonsense.

27:42.000 --> 27:43.040
If anyone helped me get ahead,

27:43.040 --> 27:43.961
it was Commander Wang.

27:44.320 --> 27:45.600
What the heck does Mo have
to do with it?

27:51.760 --> 27:53.280
I'll show him

27:54.240 --> 27:55.520
exactly

27:55.960 --> 27:57.560
who he's messing with.

28:02.080 --> 28:04.200
(Shaqiong Town Border)

28:20.040 --> 28:20.760
Did you hear?

28:21.080 --> 28:23.320
Shaqiong is fighting
the Wangur tribe again.

28:23.640 --> 28:24.560
Their grain supply was cut off,

28:24.560 --> 28:25.600
so the higher-ups want us

28:25.600 --> 28:26.880
to send two thousand dan of grain.

28:28.080 --> 28:29.080
Another lousy assignment.

28:29.520 --> 28:30.400
We'll probably have to

28:30.400 --> 28:31.320
go through Yelang Valley.

28:31.720 --> 28:33.120
It's all desert along the way.

28:33.200 --> 28:34.120
Extremely dangerous.

28:37.920 --> 28:38.480
Commander.

28:39.560 --> 28:40.920
As for the grain shipment to Shaqiong,

28:41.600 --> 28:42.960
I'd like to lead the troops there.

28:43.240 --> 28:44.400
Company Commander Zhao,

28:45.280 --> 28:47.040
eager, aren't you?

28:48.200 --> 28:49.520
You promised

28:50.400 --> 28:51.360
that when the time came,

28:52.560 --> 28:53.760
merit would be rewarded.

28:54.200 --> 28:54.920
Unfortunately,

28:55.480 --> 28:56.600
I've already assigned

28:57.080 --> 28:59.200
this mission to Lu Dahu.

29:01.280 --> 29:02.360
Company Commander Zhao,

29:03.160 --> 29:05.000
if you really want to go,

29:06.160 --> 29:08.320
you'll have to go as his second.

29:13.400 --> 29:14.480
Yes, Commander.

29:18.400 --> 29:20.760
Zhao's currying favor with the brass
and dragging us into it.

29:20.760 --> 29:21.760
Fine. Let him come.

29:22.120 --> 29:23.280
I'll make his life miserable.

29:23.520 --> 29:25.640
I can collect the rest of the heads
on the way.

29:26.200 --> 29:27.440
Thirty-six in all.

29:28.640 --> 29:30.120
I was twenty-four short.

29:31.280 --> 29:32.720
I've got four now.

29:33.720 --> 29:35.080
Twenty more,

29:36.440 --> 29:38.080
and I'll be a battalion commander.

29:40.280 --> 29:41.120
Battalion commander...

29:45.080 --> 29:45.720
Zhao Ling.

29:49.960 --> 29:50.960
I've been looking for you.

29:52.200 --> 29:53.360
Sen

29:53.360 --> 29:54.640
submitted an enlistment request.

29:55.320 --> 29:56.440
He's way too young.

29:56.440 --> 29:57.441
How could you

29:58.200 --> 30:00.080
stamp his application?

30:00.960 --> 30:01.600
What?

30:03.160 --> 30:04.080
You didn't know?

30:06.160 --> 30:07.040
You two.

30:07.600 --> 30:09.480
Has Sen said anything about enlisting?

30:10.280 --> 30:11.320
No, Mr. Zhao.

30:11.640 --> 30:12.520
Never heard a word.

30:14.560 --> 30:15.240
It wasn't me.

30:38.440 --> 30:39.240
As for joining the army...

30:40.400 --> 30:41.320
forget it.

30:41.960 --> 30:43.440
I've had Mo Yi
withdraw your application.

30:43.720 --> 30:44.920
And you stole my seal?

30:45.240 --> 30:46.200
You've got some nerve!

30:46.440 --> 30:47.600
Who are you to tell me what to do?

30:47.600 --> 30:49.000
I'm the one putting food on your table!

30:50.800 --> 30:52.240
Miss Xie makes the food!

30:52.520 --> 30:53.640
Not you!

30:54.040 --> 30:55.480
Then I just won't eat here anymore!

30:55.800 --> 30:56.840
I don't need you bossing me around!

30:56.960 --> 30:58.680
You're not my father or my brother!

31:04.320 --> 31:04.720
I...

31:06.960 --> 31:07.520
Sen.

31:07.720 --> 31:08.240
Sen.

31:09.080 --> 31:09.760
Sen.

31:12.360 --> 31:12.840
Mr. Zhao.

31:26.200 --> 31:27.520
He's just a kid.

31:27.840 --> 31:28.720
Why get so worked up over him?

31:29.920 --> 31:30.800
I didn't.

31:46.480 --> 31:47.680
I came to say goodbye.

31:49.240 --> 31:50.080
I just received my orders.

31:50.640 --> 31:52.080
I'm escorting supplies
to Shaqiong Town tomorrow.

31:53.800 --> 31:55.160
Take care while you're in Ganlin Town.

32:06.600 --> 32:07.520
In the army,

32:07.520 --> 32:08.560
one wrong move

32:08.560 --> 32:09.800
can get you killed.

32:10.920 --> 32:12.360
Study hard for a couple of years,

32:12.920 --> 32:14.240
then take the military exam.

32:14.680 --> 32:15.880
That's the right way to do it.

32:17.280 --> 32:18.680
Then you won't have to

32:19.320 --> 32:20.240
risk your life out here like us.

32:24.080 --> 32:25.200
Mr. Zhao is only looking out for you.

32:32.360 --> 32:33.160
Fei!

32:34.680 --> 32:35.560
Fei!

32:45.800 --> 32:46.880
Who knows how long

32:46.880 --> 32:48.080
they'll be gone this time.

32:48.160 --> 32:49.760
I don't even know if the food
and clothes I packed

32:49.760 --> 32:50.880
will be enough.

32:51.520 --> 32:52.280
Yeah.

32:52.560 --> 32:53.840
Zhao Ling's fiancee

32:54.600 --> 32:55.560
came to see him off with provisions.

32:56.720 --> 32:59.160
Zhao Ling is no match for me
in any respect.

32:59.440 --> 33:01.520
How'd he land a woman that pretty?

33:04.920 --> 33:07.160
If a man never comes back
from this trip,

33:07.760 --> 33:08.880
what happens

33:09.200 --> 33:10.200
to his woman?

33:13.200 --> 33:16.400
(Shaqiong Town)

33:16.400 --> 33:16.880
Go on.

33:16.880 --> 33:17.160
Move.

33:17.480 --> 33:18.160
Come rest over here.

33:18.640 --> 33:19.320
Give me one too.

33:20.200 --> 33:20.520
Here.

33:26.040 --> 33:27.000
Push.

33:27.880 --> 33:28.880
Come on.

33:29.080 --> 33:29.640
Push!

33:29.720 --> 33:30.400
Push!

33:31.320 --> 33:33.720
Come on!

33:33.720 --> 33:34.520
Push!

33:34.520 --> 33:36.600
One, two, three!

33:37.000 --> 33:37.840
Come on!

33:37.840 --> 33:39.760
One, two, three!

33:48.680 --> 33:49.600
Here, have some water.

33:50.120 --> 33:50.680
Drink up.

33:52.320 --> 33:52.920
Mr. Zhao.

33:57.400 --> 33:58.520
Looks like contraband salt.

34:13.040 --> 34:14.000
The army's salt

34:14.360 --> 34:16.040
comes from Lu Dahu trading with bandits.

34:18.680 --> 34:19.720
The question is

34:20.360 --> 34:22.440
whether Commander Wang
is turning a blind eye to it.

34:23.520 --> 34:24.760
Crooks dealing with crooks.

34:24.880 --> 34:26.120
They put on a respectable face,

34:26.280 --> 34:27.040
but behind closed doors,

34:27.480 --> 34:28.360
they're filthier than anyone.

34:28.960 --> 34:29.360
Come on!

34:30.680 --> 34:31.160
Look!

34:31.160 --> 34:31.720
Hurry!

34:33.800 --> 34:34.360
Hurry!

34:34.360 --> 34:35.560
They're bringing out the heads.

34:37.080 --> 34:37.560
Go!

34:39.920 --> 34:40.880
Those animals.

34:41.200 --> 34:42.440
They're using people
to fake military kills.

34:42.680 --> 34:43.760
Aren't they afraid
of what'll come back to them?

34:57.640 --> 34:58.880
- What are you doing?
- What are you doing? Zhao Ling!

34:59.040 --> 35:00.400
Don't act so righteous.

35:01.240 --> 35:03.360
I need 36 heads to become
a battalion commander.

35:04.080 --> 35:06.480
Twelve heads can get a company commander
promoted to deputy battalion commander,

35:06.840 --> 35:08.280
or 24 warhorses.

35:14.080 --> 35:14.600
Here.

35:15.040 --> 35:16.280
Have one of your men finish him off.

35:16.440 --> 35:18.200
I'll let you claim the kill.

35:20.040 --> 35:20.680
What are you doing?

35:21.240 --> 35:21.841
Mr. Zhao!

35:21.841 --> 35:22.240
Mr. Zhao!

35:22.240 --> 35:22.921
Mr. Zhao!

35:24.600 --> 35:27.040
Do you think I got where I am today

35:27.720 --> 35:28.680
because of

35:29.000 --> 35:30.560
my brother-in-law?

35:31.520 --> 35:32.520
It's because

35:32.760 --> 35:35.000
I am better

35:35.680 --> 35:37.120
than all you useless scum.

35:38.760 --> 35:40.720
Even if my brother-in-law
were standing right here,

35:43.440 --> 35:45.000
on this mission,

35:46.720 --> 35:49.080
I, Lu Dahu, give the orders.

35:56.200 --> 35:57.960
Just one rank above you,

35:59.240 --> 36:00.480
and I can crush you.

36:21.640 --> 36:22.120
Move!

36:23.880 --> 36:24.440
Take him away.

36:33.760 --> 36:34.400
Run! Hurry!

36:34.400 --> 36:35.240
Mr. Zhao!

36:36.360 --> 36:37.080
Stop!

36:37.160 --> 36:38.160
Stop!

36:38.760 --> 36:39.440
Get out!

36:39.680 --> 36:40.160
Mr. Zhao!

36:41.520 --> 36:42.080
Mr. Zhao!

36:42.760 --> 36:43.160
Mr. Zhao.

36:45.760 --> 36:47.600
Zhao Ling attacked a superior officer.

36:48.080 --> 36:49.320
He defied military orders.

36:49.880 --> 36:50.880
Under military law,

36:51.840 --> 36:53.360
kill him on sight!

36:55.240 --> 36:55.880
Come on!

36:57.000 --> 36:59.200
Looks like I'll have four more heads
to claim.

37:01.440 --> 37:03.080
Killing the four of us
won't earn you much.

37:04.920 --> 37:06.600
I'll bring back
dozens of warhorses instead!

37:09.920 --> 37:11.320
When I return to camp with those horses,

37:11.560 --> 37:13.520
I'll outrank you, and then you'll answer
to me!

37:22.040 --> 37:23.040
Prepare a report.

37:23.200 --> 37:24.040
Zhao Ling

37:24.560 --> 37:25.840
has deserted with his men.

37:37.920 --> 37:38.440
Mr. Zhao,

37:38.760 --> 37:39.920
where do we go now?

37:40.480 --> 37:41.800
We find those salt smugglers.

37:42.440 --> 37:43.440
They have salt

37:44.680 --> 37:45.400
and warhorses.

37:45.800 --> 37:46.600
That merit

37:47.880 --> 37:49.120
is as good as ours.

37:49.880 --> 37:50.360
All right!

37:53.520 --> 37:54.680
Go tell Miss Xie for me.

37:55.480 --> 37:56.040
Tell her

37:56.960 --> 37:57.880
I've gone to find warhorses

37:58.720 --> 37:59.760
and I'll be back a little later
than planned.

38:02.120 --> 38:02.880
Tell her not to worry.

38:03.120 --> 38:03.840
Yes, Mr. Zhao.

38:04.120 --> 38:04.840
I won't forget.

38:07.720 --> 38:08.400
Mr. Zhao,

38:08.800 --> 38:10.320
want me to pass along
a few words of concern?

38:13.000 --> 38:13.840
Just tell her

38:15.040 --> 38:16.680
the wild apricots in the mountains
are ripe.

38:17.720 --> 38:19.200
I'm going to pick her a whole basket

38:20.320 --> 38:21.600
so she can make candied apricots
when I get back.

38:22.240 --> 38:22.800
Got it!

38:34.560 --> 38:35.240
Sis.

38:35.560 --> 38:36.240
I'm back.

38:36.680 --> 38:37.440
I'm starving.

38:37.440 --> 38:37.960
Let's eat.

38:38.240 --> 38:40.160
Always eating, aren't you?

38:40.320 --> 38:41.640
If you'd hurry up
and get yourself a wife,

38:41.640 --> 38:43.160
you wouldn't be pestering me
all the time.

38:43.600 --> 38:44.920
Every time you come around,
it's either money

38:44.920 --> 38:45.720
or food.

38:46.440 --> 38:47.920
What am I, your personal charity

38:47.920 --> 38:48.840
and your personal cook?

38:49.000 --> 38:50.000
Cut the nonsense!

38:50.400 --> 38:51.680
I'm dead tired from this trip!

38:59.000 --> 39:00.480
Zhao Ling

39:00.960 --> 39:02.360
deserted halfway through the mission.

39:03.680 --> 39:04.600
I had to handle

39:05.000 --> 39:07.080
the whole thing myself.

39:15.720 --> 39:16.440
Zhao Ling

39:16.800 --> 39:17.680
deserted?

39:17.920 --> 39:18.960
This trip

39:18.960 --> 39:20.320
was well worth it.

39:21.560 --> 39:23.520
I've finally got enough heads

39:24.640 --> 39:25.960
to become a battalion commander.

39:26.520 --> 39:27.160
Dahu,

39:28.840 --> 39:30.600
doesn't that mean
you're getting promoted?

39:30.960 --> 39:31.960
You bet.

39:32.280 --> 39:32.880
Oh, right.

39:33.840 --> 39:35.960
Go pray for me
at Dadong Temple tomorrow.

39:36.640 --> 39:37.720
Ask for...

39:41.560 --> 39:43.360
a promotion and plenty of money.

39:46.080 --> 39:46.920
Bodhisattva,

39:47.360 --> 39:49.400
(Health, Career, Marriage, Wealth)
please bless my brother

39:49.400 --> 39:50.761
with rank and riches.

39:51.760 --> 39:52.520
And while you're at it,

39:52.640 --> 39:53.880
send me a sister-in-law

39:53.960 --> 39:55.760
who's easy to handle

39:55.880 --> 39:57.800
and does as she's told.

39:58.640 --> 39:59.880
Please grant my wish.

40:01.400 --> 40:02.360
Madam.

40:04.800 --> 40:05.960
Ms. Zuo?

40:07.000 --> 40:09.001
I couldn't help overhearing

40:09.280 --> 40:11.000
that you're looking for an obedient wife
for your brother.

40:12.400 --> 40:13.961
The perfect match

40:14.720 --> 40:16.080
is right under your nose.

40:17.040 --> 40:18.200
I've heard

40:18.200 --> 40:20.200
Zhao Ling isn't coming back.

40:20.480 --> 40:21.680
That leaves Miss Xie

40:21.840 --> 40:24.040
all alone with no one to depend on.

40:24.480 --> 40:25.920
A woman on her own,

40:25.920 --> 40:27.080
with no family to rely on.

40:27.240 --> 40:28.920
What choice would she have

40:28.920 --> 40:30.160
but to depend on her husband's family?

40:33.520 --> 40:35.320
Miss Xie knows how to run a household,

40:35.720 --> 40:37.520
and she has her land
to bring in an income.

40:38.160 --> 40:39.520
A wife like that

40:40.040 --> 40:42.160
would certainly treat
her sister-in-law well.

40:46.800 --> 40:48.040
You have a point.

40:48.960 --> 40:50.600
Thank you for the suggestion, Ms. Zuo.

40:52.280 --> 40:53.720
Thank you, Bodhisattva,
for answering my prayer.

40:53.880 --> 40:54.760
This way,

40:55.440 --> 40:57.040
I get everything I want at once.

40:57.120 --> 40:58.440
Being a widow is nothing.

40:59.400 --> 41:00.600
The worst thing for a woman

41:01.080 --> 41:03.120
is marrying a rotten man.

41:03.200 --> 41:03.920
Drinking,

41:04.280 --> 41:05.080
gambling,

41:05.160 --> 41:06.040
beating his wife...

41:07.440 --> 41:09.880
my brother checks every box.

41:12.640 --> 41:14.000
Thank you, Bodhisattva,
for answering my prayer.

41:14.280 --> 41:15.720
Thank you, Bodhisattva.

41:20.760 --> 41:23.320
(Next Episode)

41:23.720 --> 41:25.280
(I thought Lu Dahu)

41:25.440 --> 41:26.720
(was just a shameless lecher.)

41:26.880 --> 41:28.360
(I figured I could just stay
out of his way.)

41:28.840 --> 41:29.720
(Who would've thought)

41:30.320 --> 41:32.480
(he'd do something this vile,)

41:32.680 --> 41:33.720
(and even make
Mr. Zhao's life miserable.)

41:34.160 --> 41:35.360
A monster like that

41:36.520 --> 41:37.840
isn't worth dirtying our hands over.

41:39.480 --> 41:40.880
Xie!

41:40.880 --> 41:43.640
You have to marry him

41:43.640 --> 41:45.280
right this second!

41:50.480 --> 41:51.200
Zhao Ling.

41:51.200 --> 41:52.680
Please don't kill me!

41:53.000 --> 41:54.520
Please don't kill me!

41:54.520 --> 41:55.961
Please! I'm begging you!

41:56.080 --> 41:57.880
Lu Dahu,

41:59.720 --> 42:01.600
you scumbag!

42:13.401 --> 42:17.721
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

42:21.321 --> 42:25.681
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

42:27.801 --> 42:32.441
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

42:32.681 --> 42:35.481
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

42:36.641 --> 42:41.281
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

42:44.481 --> 42:51.321
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

42:52.201 --> 42:58.721
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

42:59.681 --> 43:03.121
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:03.641 --> 43:07.841
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

43:08.121 --> 43:13.801
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

43:25.921 --> 43:29.801
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

43:33.721 --> 43:37.721
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

43:39.441 --> 43:44.121
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

43:44.441 --> 43:47.121
♪Kept close within my heart♪

43:48.201 --> 43:53.041
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

43:56.561 --> 44:03.481
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

44:04.361 --> 44:10.841
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

44:11.721 --> 44:15.241
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

44:15.681 --> 44:20.041
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

44:20.241 --> 44:25.961
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
